sequenceDiagram
  actor S as Solicitante
  actor T as Tecnico
  participant FE as Frontend
  participant CTRL as RoosterDeskController
  participant SVC as RoosterDeskService
  participant WS as MensagensGateway
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  S->>FE: descreve o problema
  FE->>CTRL: POST /chamados
  CTRL->>SVC: validateTicketClassification()
  SVC->>DB: cria Ticket status=Aberto
  CTRL-->>FE: 201

  T->>FE: assume o chamado
  FE->>CTRL: PATCH /chamados/:id/atribuir
  CTRL->>SVC: verifica tecnico pertence ao setor
  SVC->>DB: atualiza tecnicoId
  SVC->>DB: cria HistoricoTicket (RN009)

  T->>FE: responde ao solicitante
  FE->>CTRL: POST /chamados/:id/mensagens
  CTRL->>SVC: createMensagemChamado()
  SVC->>DB: cria MensagemTicket
  SVC->>WS: emite evento em tempo real
  WS-->>FE: mensagem aparece na conversa do solicitante

  T->>FE: marca como resolvido
  FE->>CTRL: PATCH /chamados/:id/status
  CTRL->>CTRL: statusTransitionAction() exige 'encerrar' (RN005)
  CTRL->>SVC: derivarEncerradoEm() (RN006)
  SVC->>DB: atualiza status + encerradoEm + historico
